{"unit_id":"feiyang-dev__dsh-usage-plugin#card-zh","repo":"feiyang-dev/dsh-usage-plugin","commit":"c398d3dbf34ecffc689a326410ea91900a5e8ad5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness Usage & Cost Tracker 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的用量与费用插件。宿主端监听模型流并记录 token、缓存用量及结束原因，按模型和峰谷时段估算费用。网页面板提供总览、日历、缓存明细、价格表、预算和服务商余额查询，也支持 CSV、JSON、PNG 导出及记录导入。记录保存在本机专用目录，并可设置月度预算、查看助手消息的 token 统计。适合希望了解模型调用成本、缓存使用和账户余额的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:930","lib/index.js:2024","lib/client.js:2266","lib/client.js:2507"]}
{"unit_id":"feiyang-dev__dsh-usage-plugin#card-en","repo":"feiyang-dev/dsh-usage-plugin","commit":"c398d3dbf34ecffc689a326410ea91900a5e8ad5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DeepSeek Harness Usage & Cost Tracker adds usage and cost panels to DSH web. It records tokens and cache usage, estimates costs by model and peak/off-peak period, and displays calendars, prices, budgets, and balances. Users can import records and export CSV, JSON, or PNG. History is stored locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:930","lib/index.js:2024","lib/client.js:2266","lib/client.js:2507"]}
